From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh Bowman-Matthews <josh@joshmatthews.net>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:27:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Update rustls to unbreak CI. (#48079)

rustls 0.23.44 has a cargo-deny error:
```
TLS 1.3 handshake messages incorrectly accepted across encryption level boundaries: rustls 0.23.44 registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index
```

https://github.com/rustls/rustls/security/advisories/GHSA-2mjx-qc3c-rqvc

Testing: Existing tests verify SSL support.

Fork note: backport of upstream 866d0957e4f (#48079), which landed after
base/2026-08-29. The base ships rustls 0.23.43, which the same advisory
covers, so `./mach test-tidy` fails in cargo-deny on plain ohos-main.
Upstream went 0.23.43 -> 0.23.44 (#47972) -> 0.23.45 (#48079); this commit
takes the rustls hunk only, jumping straight to 0.23.45. The unrelated
`cssparser-macros` syn 2 -> 3 hunk of #48079 is left out.

Drop at the next sync: every later base contains 866d0957e4f, so this commit
applies empty and becomes a `Superseded-by: 866d0957e4f` placeholder (runbook
decision 3).

Validation: `./mach test-tidy` passes (before: cargo-deny error at deny.toml:644, GHSA-2mjx-qc3c-rqvc for rustls 0.23.43); `./mach check --release` and `./mach check --ohos` compile. The rustls entry in Cargo.lock matches upstream 866d0957e4f exactly and was produced by `cargo update -p rustls --precise 0.23.45`, which changed nothing else.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; cherry-pick of upstream 866d0957e4f with the Cargo.lock conflict resolved by `cargo update -p rustls --precise 0.23.45`, no code changes)
Signed-off-by: Josh Matthews <josh@joshmatthews.net>
(cherry picked from commit 866d0957e4fcd684570939809baed7accc791116)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 Cargo.lock | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 0a29ee1fcb9..f8b68eac03a 100644
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -7462,9 +7462,9 @@ dependencies = [
 
 [[package]]
 name = "rustls"
-version = "0.23.43"
+version = "0.23.45"
 source = "registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index"
-checksum = "0283386ce02abc0151e1761d08802dfe86c173b0b494af5cbc086574e453da06"
+checksum = "0d41d731c7d2f962d1ccc364cec258de3c0e93b38c2fb3ba97ac74513048d634"
 dependencies = [
  "aws-lc-rs",
  "log",
